      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners offer glowing praise for founder Sasha Armstrong, describing her as an intuitive and deeply committed behavior coach. Clients value her focus on canine psychology and energy-centered owner education. However, one client felt misled and reported dismissive communication during a board-and-train stay."
      }
