        "en": "Compassionate care alongside boarding concern"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A large majority of reviewers describe peaceful, enriching experiences where their dogs thrive during farm boarding stays and retreat visits. In contrast, one reviewer reported severe distress, alleging their dog returned from boarding neglected with dirty bedding and untreated gastrointestinal illness."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
