      "title": {
        "en": "Transformative human-dog relationship building"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently report lasting breakthroughs in mutual trust, calmer demeanors, and deeper understanding between dogs and their families. While most owners find her non-traditional approach highly effective, one dissatisfied client found the instruction to ignore their pet unhelpful."
      }
